Option Flavour Natural
' Maze.nat - a robot finds its way out of a maze by keeping a hand on the right-hand wall.
' The words are Robot.cls's. (c) 2026 Cyborg Unicorn Pty Ltd - MIT License
with the robot
enter the maze
show

while not home
  if clear right
    turn right
    forward
  else
    if clear ahead forward else turn left end
  end
end

show
say "Out in" steps "steps."
